{"schema_version": "1.0", "session_id": "6a2f58b6-2ea8-4d1d-bd1d-b666c596441b", "team_id": "contest2026_062_PharosTech", "github_login": "yunline", "tool": "copilot", "seq": 9, "ts": "2026-07-29T16:41:07.687000+00:00", "role": "user", "text": "实际上nuttx源码里有同款uart ip的驱动代码，但是是全静态注册的。你可以去看看他们是怎么写的"}
